# Imprisoned in the Moon on Bot1's own Plains: it keeps its land type and the basic supertype (the ruling) but loses its intrinsic mana
# ability and taps only for {C}, so with that {C} alone Savannah Lions ({W}) cannot be cast. Mox Jet, an artifact that is neither creature,
# land nor planeswalker, is not a legal thing to enchant.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Plains
Imprisoned in the Moon
Savannah Lions
Mox Jet
Island x2
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
! Bot1.Hand.Imprisoned in the Moon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Hand.Imprisoned in the Moon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Types = Land
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Subtypes = Plains
? Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Supertypes = Basic
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast(Mana: short)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Savannah Lions
